+## Technical Approach
+
+`initialState(items)` validates unique ids and returns a new `{ items }` state with every item set to `status: 'pending'` and `selected: false`. `toggleSelection` first finds the requested item; it returns the original state if none exists, otherwise it creates a new array and replaces only the selected item. `approveSelected` similarly returns the original state when nothing is selected, otherwise it confirms selected items and clears selection on every item. A browser-only renderer delegates all UI changes to these functions and uses native buttons, truthful `aria-pressed`, and the `disabled` property for the Approve control.
