+
+| Evidence type | Required for state | Verifiable by | Path / convention |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| Immutable transition tests | IMPL-GREEN | node:test | `test/review-state.test.js` |
+| Accessible-control contract | IMPL-GREEN | node:test | `test/review-state.test.js` |
+
+## 4. Adversarial Cases (What must NOT happen)
+
+| Condition | Must NOT happen | Probe used to verify |
+|---|---|---|
+| Duplicate ids | Ambiguous state is accepted | `initialState` throws a duplicate-id error |
+| Unknown id | State is cloned or changed | Assert strict object identity is preserved |
+| Empty selection | Any item is confirmed | Assert strict object identity is preserved |
+| Mixed selection | Unselected item status changes | Assert its status remains pending |
+
+## 5. Failure-Modes Handled
+
+| Dependency | Failure mode | Behavior | Verified by |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| Input items | Duplicate ids | Reject invalid input with an error | unit test |
+| Browser DOM | Page lacks review controls | Do not bootstrap controls | guarded browser bootstrap |
